	"system": {
		"description": "<p>The ritual ink under your skin, partially infused with monster ichor, grants you certain physical benefits. Raise one Ability Score by 1 (to a maximum of 20) and gain proficiency in its Saving Throw. If you already have proficiency in the Saving Throw, you gain an expertise die instead (to a maximum of 1d10). You also gain advantage on Saving Throws against shape-changing spells and effects. This is permanent.</p>",
